# Line endings: LF in the repository, on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows editor saving a file as CRLF changes its bytes, and the
# CI step that regenerates docs/TOOLS.md and fails on any diff would then fail on
# a difference that is only line endings — with a message claiming the docs are
# stale. Normalising here makes that impossible.
* text=auto eol=lf

# docs/TOOLS.md is generated by scripts/gen-tools-doc.mjs, never hand-edited.
# Marking it collapses it by default in GitHub diffs, so reviews stay focused on
# the source of truth (the TOOLS array in src/index.ts).
docs/TOOLS.md linguist-generated=true
